<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<!-- Семинар ба гэрийн даалгавар 15. Эх сурвалж: latex/lectures/seminars.tex, homework.tex -->
<section xml:id="sec-semhw-15" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Семинар ба гэрийн даалгавар 15</title>
  <exercises xml:id="exercises-semhw-15">
    <introduction>
      <p>Хамрах сэдэв: интеграл нийлбэр, тодорхой интегралын чанар, Ньютон–Лейбницийн томьёо, хэсэгчлэн интегралчлах ба орлуулах арга (Лекц 15).</p>
    </introduction>
    <exercise xml:id="semhw15-1">
      <statement>
        <p>Доорх функцуудын хувьд өгөгдсөн завсрыг
        <m>n=4</m> адил урттай хуваагаад
        <me>\sum_{k=1}^4 f(x_k^*)\,\Delta x</me>
        нийлбэрийг тооцоол.
        Энд <m>x_k^*</m> нь дараах гурван тохиолдлоор авна:</p>
        <p><ol>
        <li><alert>a)</alert> завсрын <alert>зүүн</alert> төгсгөл</li>
        <li><alert>b)</alert> завсрын <alert>дундаж</alert> цэг</li>
        <li><alert>c)</alert> завсрын <alert>баруун</alert> төгсгөл</li>
      </ol></p>
        <p>Бүх тохиолдолд график зурж, тухайн нийлбэрийг илэрхийлж буй тэгш өнцөгтүүдийн талбайг харуул.</p>
        <p><ol>
        <li><m>f(x)=3x+1</m>, завсар: <m>[2,\,6]</m></li>
        <li><m>f(x)=\frac{1}{x}</m>, завсар: <m>[1,\,9]</m></li>
        <li><m>f(x)=\cos x</m>, завсар: <m>[0,\,\pi]</m></li>
        <li><m>f(x)=2x-x^2</m>, завсар: <m>[-1,\,3]</m></li>
      </ol></p>
      </statement>
    </exercise>
    <exercise xml:id="semhw15-2">
      <statement>
        <p><me>f(x)=
        \begin{cases}
        |x-2|, &amp; x\ge0,\\[4pt]
        x+2, &amp; x\lt 0.
        \end{cases}</me> бол дараах интегралуудыг ол.</p>
        <p><ol>
        <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{-2}^{0} f(x)\,dx</m></li>
        <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{-2}^{2} f(x)\,dx</m></li>
        <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{0}^{6} f(x)\,dx</m></li>
        <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{-4}^{6} f(x)\,dx</m></li>
      </ol></p>
      </statement>
    </exercise>
    <exercise xml:id="semhw15-3">
      <statement>
        <p><me>f(x)=
        \begin{cases}
        2x, &amp; x\le1,\\[4pt]
        2, &amp; x\gt 1.
        \end{cases}</me>
        бол дараах интегралуудыг ол.</p>
        <p><ol>
        <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{0}^{1} f(x)\,dx</m></li>
        <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{-1}^{1} f(x)\,dx</m></li>
        <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{1}^{10} f(x)\,dx</m></li>
        <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{1/2}^{5} f(x)\,dx</m></li>
      </ol></p>
      </statement>
    </exercise>
    <exercise xml:id="semhw15-4">
      <statement>
        <p>Доорх зураг нь <m>y=f(x)</m> муруй ба <m>ox</m> тэнхлэгийн хоорондох талбайн утгуудыг (<m>S</m>) өгөв. Тэдгээрийг ашиглан
        <me>\int_a^b f(x)\,dx,\quad
        \int_b^c f(x)\,dx,\quad
        \int_a^c f(x)\,dx,\quad
        \int_a^d f(x)\,dx</me> интегралуудыг ол.</p>

        <image width="70%"><latex-image>
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.5]
  \draw[-&gt;] (-0.2,0) -- (5.2,0) node[right]{$x$};
  \draw[-&gt;] (0,-1) -- (0,2) node[above]{$y$};

  \coordinate (A) at (0.5,0);
  \coordinate (B) at (1.5,0);
  \coordinate (C) at (2.8,0);
  \coordinate (D) at (4.5,0);

  \node[below] at (A) {$a$};
  \node[below] at (B) {$b$};
  \node[below] at (C) {$c$};
  \node[below] at (D) {$d$};

  \draw[thick,domain=0.3:4.7,smooth]
     plot(\x,{0.8*sin(120*\x)+0.3*\x-0.5});

  \fill[blue!20] (A) --
    plot[domain=0.5:1.5,smooth] (\x,{0.8*sin(120*\x)+0.3*\x-0.5}) --
    (B) -- cycle;
  \node at (1,0.6) {\small $S=0.8$};

  \fill[cyan!25] (B) --
    plot[domain=1.5:3,smooth] (\x,{0.8*sin(120*\x)+0.3*\x-0.5}) --
    (C) -- cycle;
  \node at (2.2,-1) {\small $S=1$};

  \fill[red!20] (C) --
    plot[domain=3:4.5,smooth] (\x,{0.8*sin(120*\x)+0.3*\x-0.5}) --
    (D) -- cycle;
  \node at (3.8,1.2) {\small $S=1.6$};

  \node[right] at (4.7,1.8) {$y=f(x)$};
\end{tikzpicture}
</latex-image></image>

          </statement>
        </exercise>
        <exercise xml:id="semhw15-5">
          <statement>
            <p>Дараах функцүүдийн график ба <m>ox</m> тэнхлэгийн өгөгдсөн интервалаар хүрээлэгдсэн хэсгийн талбайг ол.</p>
            <p><ol>
            <li><m>f(x)=x^3,\quad [2,3]</m></li>
            <li><m>f(x)=x^4,\quad [-1,1]</m></li>
            <li><m>f(x)=3\sqrt{x},\quad [1,4]</m></li>
            <li><m>f(x)=x^{-2/3},\quad [1,27]</m></li>
            <li><m>f(x)=e^{2x},\quad [0,\ln2]</m></li>
            <li><m>f(x)=\dfrac1x,\quad [1,5]</m></li>
          </ol></p>
          </statement>
        </exercise>
        <exercise xml:id="semhw15-6">
          <statement>
            <p>Дараах интегралуудыг Ньютон-Лейбницийн теоремийг ашиглан бод.</p>
            <p><ol>
            <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{-2}^{1}(x^2-6x+12)\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{-1}^{2}4x(1-x^2)\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{1}^{4}\frac{4}{x^2}\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{1}^{2}\frac1{x^6}\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{4}^{9}2x\sqrt{x}\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{1}^{4}\frac1{x\sqrt{x}}\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{-\pi/2}^{\pi/2}\sin\theta\,d\theta</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{0}^{\pi/4}\sec^2\theta\,d\theta</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{-\pi/4}^{\pi/4}\cos x\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{0}^{\pi/3}(2x-\sec x\tan x)\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{\ln2}^{3}5e^x\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{1/2}^{1}\frac1{2x}\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{-1}^{1}\frac1{1+x^2}\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{0}^{1/\sqrt2}\frac{dx}{\sqrt{1-x^2}}</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{\sqrt2}^{2}\frac{dx}{x\sqrt{x^2-1}}</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{-\sqrt3}^{-2/\sqrt3}\frac{dx}{x\sqrt{x^2-1}}</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{1}^{4}\left(\frac1{\sqrt t}-3\sqrt t\right)\,dt</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle\int_{\pi/6}^{\pi/2}\left(x+\frac2{\sin^2 x}\right)\,dx</m></li>
          </ol></p>
          </statement>
        </exercise>
        <exercise xml:id="semhw15-7">
          <statement>
            <p>Дараах интегралуудын уламжлалыг ол.</p>
            <p><ol>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \frac{d}{dx}\int_{1}^{x}\sin(t^2)\,dt</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \frac{d}{dx}\int_{0}^{x} e^{\sqrt{t}}\,dt</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \frac{d}{dx}\int_{0}^{x}\frac{dt}{1+\sqrt{t}}</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \frac{d}{dx}\int_{1}^{x}\ln t\,dt</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \frac{d}{dx}\int_{x}^{0} t\sec t\,dt</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \frac{d}{du}\int_{0}^{u}|x|\,dx</m></li>
          </ol></p>
          </statement>
        </exercise>
        <exercise xml:id="semhw15-8">
          <statement>
            <p><m>\displaystyle F(x)=\int_{4}^{x}\sqrt{t^2+9}\,dt</m> бол
            <m>\text{(a) }F(4),\qquad \text{(b) } F'(4),\qquad \text{(c) }F''(4)</m> ол.</p>
          </statement>
        </exercise>
        <exercise xml:id="semhw15-9">
          <statement>
            <p>Тодорхой интегралыг орлуулах аргаар бод.</p>
            <p><ol>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{0}^{1}(2x+1)^3\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{1}^{2}(4x-2)^3\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{0}^{1}(2x-1)^3\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{1}^{2}(4-3x)^8\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{0}^{8}x\sqrt{1+x}\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{-3}^{0}x\sqrt{1-x}\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{0}^{\pi/2}4\sin\frac{x}{2}\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{0}^{\pi/6}2\cos3x\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{-2}^{-1}\frac{x}{(x^2+2)^3}\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{1-\pi}^{1+\pi}\sec^2\!\Bigl(\frac14 x-\frac14\Bigr)\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{-\ln3}^{\ln3}\frac{e^{x}}{e^x+4}\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{0}^{\ln5}e^{x}(3-4e^x)\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{1}^{3}\frac{dx}{\sqrt{x}(x+1)}</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{\ln2}^{\ln(2/\sqrt3)}
            \frac{e^{-x}\,dx}{\sqrt{\,1-e^{-2x}\,}}</m></li>
          </ol></p>
          </statement>
        </exercise>
        <exercise xml:id="semhw15-10">
          <statement>
            <p>Тодорхой интегралыг хэсэгчлэх аргаар бод.</p>
            <p><ol>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{0}^{\ln2} x e^{-x}\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{0}^{\pi} x\sin x\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{0}^{2\pi} x^3\cos x\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{1/e}^{e} |\ln x|\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{0}^{\sqrt3} x\arctan x\,dx</m></li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{0}^{\pi} e^x\sin x\,dx</m></li>
          </ol></p>
          </statement>
        </exercise>
        <exercise xml:id="semhw15-11">
          <statement>
            <p>Интегралыг бод.</p>
            <p><ol>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{0}^{1} x\,(2-x^{2})^{18}\,dx</m>.</li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{-1}^{1} \frac{x\,dx}{x^{2}+x+1}</m>.</li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int (x\ln x)^{2}\,dx</m>.</li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{0}^{9} x^{3}\sqrt[3]{1-x}\,dx</m>.</li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{-2}^{-1} \frac{dx}{x\sqrt{x^{2}-1}}</m>.</li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{1/2}^{1} x^{16}\sqrt{1+3x^{8}}\,dx</m>.</li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{0}^{3} \arcsin\sqrt{\frac{x}{1+x}}\,dx</m>.</li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{0}^{2\pi} \frac{dx}{(2+\cos x)(3+\cos x)}</m>.</li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{0}^{2\pi} \frac{dx}{\sin^{4}x+\cos^{4}x}</m>.</li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{0}^{\pi/2} \sin x\,\sin 2x\,\sin 3x\,dx</m>.</li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{0}^{\pi} (x\sin x)^{2}\,dx</m>.</li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{0}^{\pi} e^{x}\cos^{3}x\,dx</m>.</li>
            <li><m>\displaystyle \int_{0}^{\ln 2} \sinh^{4}x\,dx</m>.</li>
          </ol></p>
          </statement>
        </exercise>
      </exercises>
    </section>
